    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2224600/extras/d9f4727865a9c0611c34368868a6970d.avif?t=1671181763\" /></div><br><br>Experience the sensation of sailing the most impressive ships across the ocean. Cross the seas and complete missions to feel what it's like to be on the high <br>seas. <br> <br>Enjoy high quality graphics in realistic scenarios navigating in cruise ships, pirate ship, lifeboat, jet skis, aircraft carriers and much more.<br><br>If you like realistic games where to live an experience of another level this is your game. Enjoy the action and speed in Boat Simulator. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2224600/extras/16daefa4532a2dcd8851456bfd4139af.avif?t=1671181763\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Realistic graphics</strong> and sounds.</li><li>Choose from <strong>more than 10 boats.</strong></li><li>Atmospheric <strong>weather changes.</strong></li><li>Accomplish <strong>missions</strong> and sail the open sea without limits. Enjoy the voyage in an <strong>open world.</strong></li><li>Several <strong>cinematic cameras.</strong></li><li>Avoid obstacles and test the <strong>circuits.</strong></li><li>Try from <strong>vintage ships</strong> to the most current ones</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2224600/extras/9b245ec62fb35701ac0ea7287928dd7e.avif?t=1671181763\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2224600/extras/f4345820003ec059876e7e770a42cf04.avif?t=1671181763\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Container Ship</strong></li><li><strong>Zodiac</strong></li><li><strong>Lifeboat</strong></li><li><strong>Sailboat</strong></li><li><strong>PirateShip</strong></li><li><strong>Yacht</strong></li><li><strong>Cruise</strong></li><li><strong>Aircraft carrier</strong></li><li><strong>Jet ski</strong></li><li><strong>Fishing boat</strong></li><li><strong>Speedboat</strong></li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2224600/extras/4ecf3f672ea03b3cbd3ac7f03fe5e515.avif?t=1671181763\" /></div><br><br><strong>Experience the journey</strong> and explore the vast sea that lies before you. Accomplish your mission and improve your <strong>sailing skills</strong>, endless adventures await you. <br><br>Are you ready for this adventure on the high seas?",
